These PNGs are stand-ins. The word PLACEHOLDER is burned into them
so they cannot be mistaken for finished faces.

The firmware does not use them. Cyber and Vik are drawn in code
(see assets/bots.json; leave "image" unset for the animated mark).

To drop in your own:
  1. Export a square PNG. Transparent background is fine.
  2. Put it in this folder.
  3. In assets/bots.json set "image": "avatars/your.png".
  4. python3 tools/png_to_c.py
  5. Rebuild the firmware.

A PNG replaces the drawn shape. It will not blink. It still bobs.
